{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10194","headline":"奉和杜相公长兴新宅即事呈元相公 · 李嘉佑","name":"奉和杜相公长兴新宅即事呈元相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"意有空门乐，居无甲第奢。\n经过容法侣，雕饰让侯家。\n隐树重檐肃，开园一迳斜。\n据梧听好鸟，行药寄名花。\n梦蝶留清簟，垂貂坐绦纱。\n当山不掩户，映日自倾茶。\n雅望归安石，深知在叔牙。\n还成吉甫颂，赠荅比瑶华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10194.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10194","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}